OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cold, grey morning with frost
OL,6,Fover high ground. Cloudy through the
OL,7,Fafternoon and remaining cold inland,
OL,8,Fbut milder and breezier along the
OL,9,Fcoast, where there may be the odd
OL,10,Fshower.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FGenerally cloudy and dry, but
OL,13,Fa few showers are possible towards the
OL,14,Feast and in particular along the
OL,15,Fcoast. Becoming chilly with a frost
OL,16,Fpossible over higher ground.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
FL,165,160,301,260,100,100
