OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FRather cloudy through
OL,6,FThursday with some showers possible at
OL,7,Ffirst towards the coast. Perhaps a few
OL,8,Fbright spells during the afternoon.
OL,9,FTurning cold and frosty overnight.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FCloudy
OL,12,Fon Friday with rain and hill snow
OL,13,Fgradually spreading east and becoming
OL,14,Fcold overnight. Outbreaks of rain or
OL,15,Fsleet on Saturday. Becoming brighter
OL,16,Fby Sunday with sunny spells.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
